{"3604350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ordealis: Edge of Struggle", "steam_appid": 3604350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ordealis: Edge of Struggle&quot; is a third-person action game with high difficulty boss battles only, where you fight using parry and evasion. The player awakens as a knight who was once called a hero but fell into a long-sealed slumber, and challenges a deadly battle with a powerful enemy in a world of ashes burned by dragon flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features challenging boss battles and tense sword action. You can enjoy the exhilaration of predicting attacks, parrying, and defeating a powerful enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise parry action: The exhilaration of judging the timing and parrying a powerful blow from an enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce boss battles: Tension-filled battles with powerful enemies with unique behavior patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-way action experience: A pure combat-only action game with no exploration elements</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ordealis: Edge of Struggle&quot; is a third-person action game with high difficulty boss battles only, where you fight using parry and evasion. The player awakens as a knight who was once called a hero but fell into a long-sealed slumber, and challenges a deadly battle with a powerful enemy in a world of ashes burned by dragon flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features challenging boss battles and tense sword action. You can enjoy the exhilaration of predicting attacks, parrying, and defeating a powerful enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P